{
	title: 'Command help',
	spec: 'Top-level tsk, tsk help, tsk --help and tsk -h show the same concise guide to every available command, including add-note, edit, del, ls and tree, their features and --format human|json|ason, with a pointer to tsk --detailed-help. Detailed help explains the full project/task format (spec rather than description, notes, once, foldInto, files, keep), and rebuild workflow with concise examples. tsk <command> --help gives command-specific usage, options and examples. Help works without running commands or loading a Tsk project.',
